From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:08:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Use absolute tail anchors in native V2 monetary validation

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Compute tail subsidy from immutable genesis tail and work anchors instead of recursively scaling the previous rounded tail. Bind those anchors into native monetary validation and development profile conversion, with updated reference and genesis consistency tests.

